The exact-weight ANE comparison is the GPU-only control above.

Result: Qwen3.8-27B prompt prefill now runs on verified ANE procedures,
beats the exact-weight GPU-only path, preserves the deterministic output,
and exceeds the CPU architecture control by a wide margin. This receipt
does not claim an ANE decode win.
